              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 text-steel-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
            </summary>
            <p class="mt-4 text-steel-600">For sesame oil, we recommend the <strong>HN325/355 Sesame Special</strong> model. It features a smaller 300mm barrel diameter that creates higher cake pressure (47-51 Mpa/cm²), which is ideal for extracting maximum oil from small sesame seeds. The standard HN325 also works well for sesame.</p>
