            <p class="mt-4 text-steel-600">If you're just starting out, a single barrel is sufficient and more affordable. For commercial operations, we strongly recommend double barrel — it nearly doubles your throughput while sharing the same hydraulic system, making it much more cost-effective per kg of oil produced. The double barrel allows continuous operation: while one barrel is pressing, you can load the other.</p>
          </details>
